---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Contact from '../../components/Contact.astro'
import logo from '../../assets/images/demo-logo_preview.png'
import tpoImage from '../../assets/images/service-tpo.webp'
import epdmImage from '../../assets/images/service-tpdm.webp'
import bitumenImage from '../../assets/images/service-bitumen.webp'

import waterDamageImage from '../../assets/images/water-damage.jpg'
import windIcon from '../../assets/icons/wind.svg'
import rainIcon from '../../assets/icons/rain.svg'
import fireIcon from '../../assets/icons/fire.svg'
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle="Comprehensive Commercial Roofing Services">
  <section id="overview" class="overview-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="text-card">
          <h1>Expert Commercial and Flat Top Roofing Services in Windsor, Ontario</h1>
          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor, sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Fugiat et odio, eius obcaecati dolore architecto? Debitis magni dolor similique deserunt. Quam rem veritatis ducimus enim aperiam. Totam obcaecati quibusdam distinctio.</p>
          <h2>Services We Provide:</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="#">Commercial Roofing</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Emergency Repairs</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Roof Replacement</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Roof Assessments</a></li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Not sure what you're looking for or just need some advice? Give us a call and we'd be happy to chat.</h3>
          <a href="#" class="cta-btn">Give Us A Call</a>
        </div>
        <img class="logo" src={logo.src} alt="">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="commercial-roofing" class="commercial-roofing-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="title-container">
        <span class="reveal reveal-grow"></span><h2 class="section-title reveal reveal-right">Commercial Roofing</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="text-card roboto">
          <h3>A Sound Roof Starts With The Right Materials</h3>
          <p>There are many material options to select from when choosing a roof for your commercial building. Each has it's pros and cons depending on budget, climate and use case - feel free to browse our guides below to some popular and time-tested options.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3 roboto materials-grid">
        <div class="card reveal reveal-up">
          <img src={tpoImage.src} alt="" class="card-img">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3>TPO Roofing</h3>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Accusantium dolorum possimus atque, inventore itaque maiores nisi id quae voluptatem amet aut eligendi vitae similique dicta?</p>
            <a class="cta-btn" href=`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/articles/tpo`>More About TPO</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal reveal-up">
          <img src={epdmImage.src} alt="" class="card-img">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3>EPDM Roofing</h3>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Accusantium dolorum possimus atque, inventore itaque maiores nisi id quae voluptatem amet aut eligendi vitae similique dicta?</p>
            <a class="cta-btn" href=`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/articles/epdm`>More About EPDM</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal reveal-up">
          <img src={bitumenImage.src} alt="" class="card-img">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3>2-Ply Bitumen Roofing</h3>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Accusantium dolorum possimus atque, inventore itaque maiores nisi id quae voluptatem amet aut eligendi vitae similique dicta?</p>
            <a class="cta-btn" href=`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/articles/bitumen`>More About Bitumen</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2 roboto">
        <div class="text-card">
          <h3>Build It To Last With The Top Professionals</h3>
          <p>Tradesmen that have decades of experience working with commerical roofing products in a variety of scenarios install roofs that meet or exceed their expected lifetimes - period. Riverside knows this and that's why we have built a team of the best roofers that know how to bring it all together to leave our clients satisfied and in a timely manner.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="roof-replacement" class="roof-replacement-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="title-container">
        <span class="reveal reveal-grow"></span><h2 class="section-title reveal reveal-right">Roof Replacement</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="text-card">
          <h3>Heading 3</h3>
          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Laboriosam quia, dignissimos veniam sapiente nam, vitae numquam mollitia quaerat nobis eum enim, nemo optio recusandae ratione?</p>
          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Laboriosam quia, dignissimos veniam sapiente nam, vitae numquam mollitia quaerat nobis eum enim, nemo optio recusandae ratione?</p>
          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Laboriosam quia, dignissimos veniam sapiente nam, vitae numquam mollitia quaerat nobis eum enim, nemo optio recusandae ratione?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="emergency-repairs" class="emergency-repairs-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="title-container">
        <span class="reveal reveal-grow"></span><h2 class="section-title reveal reveal-right">Emergency Repairs</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="text-card">
          <h3>Is Your Building In Need Of A Roofing Rescue?</h3>
          <p>Few things can disrupt business and damage your building as much an unexpected leak. From ceiling tiles and drywall to critical assets, electrical components and equipment - much can be lost in a short amount of time.</p>
          <p>If your roof has been damaged or improperly installed <strong>it is imperative to have an immediate assessment</strong> and <strong>professional repair completed</strong> before ceilings, assets and walls are damaged.</p>
          <div class="icon-collection">
            <div class="icon-container">
              <img src={windIcon.src} alt="">
              <p>Wind</p>
            </div>
            <div class="icon-container">
              <img src={rainIcon.src} alt="">
              <p>Rain</p>
            </div>
            <div class="icon-container">
              <img src={fireIcon.src} alt="">
              <p>Fire</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <img src={waterDamageImage.src} alt="" class="service-img">
        <div class="service-response-card shadow">
          <h3>Book An Emergency Assessment Today</h3>
          <p>Riverside Roofing Inc provides <strong>prompt, honest</strong> and <strong>accurate</strong> roof assessment and repair services to quickly restore your operations and peace of mind.</p>
          <a href="#" class="cta-btn">Save Your Roof</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="roof-assessments" class="roof-assessments-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="title-container">
        <span class="reveal reveal-grow"></span><h2 class="section-title reveal reveal-right">Roof Assessments</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="text-card">
          <h3>Stop A Leak Before It Starts</h3>
          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Laboriosam quia, dignissimos veniam sapiente nam, vitae numquam mollitia quaerat nobis eum enim, nemo optio recusandae ratione?</p>
          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Laboriosam quia, dignissimos veniam sapiente nam, vitae numquam mollitia quaerat nobis eum enim, nemo optio recusandae ratione?</p>
          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Laboriosam quia, dignissimos veniam sapiente nam, vitae numquam mollitia quaerat nobis eum enim, nemo optio recusandae ratione?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-response-card">
          <img src={waterDamageImage.src} alt="" class="service-img">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="contact-us" class="contact-section">
    <Contact/>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.overview-section {
  background: var(--primary-gray);
}

.roof-replacement-section {
}

.contact-section {
  background: var(--light-blue);
}

.grid-2 {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
}

.grid-3 {
  padding: 0 1rem;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 1rem;
}

.materials-grid {
  padding-bottom: 5rem;
}

ul {
  padding-left: 3rem;
  list-style-type: none;
}

li a {
  padding: 1rem 0 1rem 2rem;
  background-color: var(--primary-red);
  color: white;
  display: inline-block;
  width: clamp(10%, 250px, 80%);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-family: 'Roboto';
  font-weight: bold;
}

li {
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.service-img {
  width: clamp(10%, 500px, 80%);
}

.service-response-card {
  padding: 2rem 1rem 1rem 1rem;
  background: white;
  border: 5px solid var(--primary-blue);
  border-radius: 15px;
}

.icon-collection {
  display: flex;
  gap: 2rem;
}

.icon-container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  font-weight: bold;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: var(--primary-blue);
}

.icon-container img {
  width: 50px;
}

.text-card {
  padding: 1rem;
}
.text-card h1, .text-card p, .text-card h2 {
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.text-card h3, .card-body h3 {
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.logo {
  width: 80%;
  place-self: center;
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .grid-2, .grid-3 {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .logo {
    grid-row: 1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
}
</style>
